nam hi Deum vident.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="V, 8." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0497" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0497"></COL> Hic versus primum editus in  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ulfilae partium
