H. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">þamna.</HI></NOTE>  þai hrainjahairtans. unte þai guþ gasaiwand.— . . . ak ana lukarnastaþan. jah liuteiþ allaim
 <NOTE N="16." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0497" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0497"></COL> Sic luceat
lux vestra in praesentia hominum, ut videant vestra bona opera et celebrent patrem vestrum hunc in coelis.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="V, 16." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0498" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0498"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">liuhtjai</HI> ] H. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">liughtjai.</HI></NOTE>  þaim ïn þamma razna. sva liuhtjai liuhaþ ïzvar ïn andvairþja manne. ei gasaiwaina ïzvara goda
 <NOTE N="17." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0497" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0497"></COL> Ne putetis, quod ego venerim abrogare legem aut profetas; non veni abrogare, sed perficere.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="V, 17." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0498" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0498"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ïk</HI> ] ego,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn., B. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">ni.—ei ïk qem-
jau</HI> ] J. St. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">ei qam.</HI></NOTE>  vaurstva jah hauhjaina attan ïzvarana þana ïn himinam. ni hugjaiþ ei ïk qemjau gatairan vitoþ aiþþau
 <NOTE N="18." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0497" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0497"></COL> Amen
enim dico vobis, usque dum perit coelum et terra, iota unum aut una linea non perit de lege, donec omne fit.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="V, 18." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0498" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0498"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">jah</HI> ] H. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">jau.—allata vairþiþ.</HI>  J. St. B. †
