 <NOTE N="19." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0497" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0497"></COL> Verum qui nunc abrogat unum praeceptorum horum minimorum et doceat sic homines, hic minimus nominatur
in regno coelorum: verum qui facit et doceat sic, hic magnus nominatur in regno coelorum.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="V, 19." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0498" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0498"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">sah</HI> ] pr. Z.— <HI REND="ITALIC">sa;</HI>  caeterum  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn.— <HI REND="ITALIC">þiudangardjai</HI> ]
H. † div.— <HI REND="ITALIC">sva</HI> ] sec. sic,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr.</NOTE>  airþa. jota ains aiþþau ains striks ni usleiþiþ af vitoda. unte allata vairþiþ. ïþ saei nu gatairiþ
