 <NOTE N="21." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> dixit enim in se: si tantum attingo vestem ejus, sanor.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 21." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">jabai</HI> ] Z. † div.— <HI REND="ITALIC">þatainei</HI> ] H. † div.  <HI REND="ITALIC">vastjai</HI> ]
