ego,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn.— <HI REND="ITALIC">anahneivands</HI> ] St. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">anahneivauds</HI></NOTE>  bi hup seinana jah matida þramsteins jah miliþ haiþvisk jah merida qiþands. qimiþ svinþoza
 <NOTE N="8." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0525" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0525"></COL> At ego
