coelos et Spiritum uti columbam accedentem super eum.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="I, 10." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0527" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0527"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">usluknans</HI> ] lh.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ulfil. illustr.</HI>  p. 155 p o  <HI REND="ITALIC">usluknandans</HI> 
