 <NOTE N="12." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0527" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0527"></COL> Et statim, ecce, spiritus eum eduxit in desertum,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="I, 12." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0527" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0527"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">suns sai</HI> ] statim ecce; cum nullus graecorum
