 <NOTE N="17." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0527" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0527"></COL> Et dixit iis Iesus: venite post me et facio vos fieri captores hominum.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="I, 17." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0528" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0528"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ïgqis</HI> ] J. St. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">ïgvis;</HI>  recte Maresh. p. 414.</NOTE>  broþar ïs. þis seimonis. vairpandans nati ïn marein. vesun auk fiskjans. jah qaþ ïm ïesus
