 <NOTE N="7." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0551" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0551"></COL> Et habuerunt pisces paucos,
et hos benedicens dixit, ut apponerent etiam hos.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 7." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0551" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0551"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þans</HI> ] pr. hos,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr.</NOTE>  gabrak jah atgaf siponjam seinaim. ei atlagidedeina faur. jah atlagidedun faur þo managein. jah
 <NOTE N="8." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0551" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0551"></COL> Comederunt autem et saturi facti-sunt et sustulerunt
