 <NOTE N="21." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0551" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0551"></COL> Et dixit ad eos:
quomodo non adhuc cognoscitis?</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 21." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0552" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0552"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ni nauh</HI> ] non adhuc, gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouj,</FOREIGN>  cf. ad IV, 40;
(caeterum J. St. B. † jct.)</NOTE> <NOTE N="22." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0551" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0551"></COL> Et venerunt in Bethamam ( <HI REND="ITALIC">Vide</HI>  paginam sequentem.)
 <COL N="0553"></COL> et tulerunt ad eum caecum et orarunt eum, ut eum attingeret.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 22." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0552" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0552"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">qemun</HI> ] venerunt, gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eærcetai.</FOREIGN> — <HI REND="ITALIC">beþaniïn</HI> ]
