 <COL N="0553"></COL> <NOTE N="23." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Et apprehendens manum hujus
caeci eduxit eum extra vicum et spuens in oculos ejus, apponens insuper manus sua, interrogavit
