 <NOTE N="24." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Et suspiciens dixit: video homines quod ut arbores video euntes.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 24." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þatei</HI> ] quod,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr.— <HI REND="ITALIC">gasaiwa</HI> ] sec. video,
gr.</NOTE>  blindins ustauh ïna utana veihsis jah speivands ïn augona ïs atlagjands ana handuns
 <NOTE N="25." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Deinde iterum posuit manus super hos oculos ejus et fecit eum suspicere, et rursus sanatus fuit et vidit clare
omnes.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 25." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">aftra</HI> ] sec. rursus, pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajpov</FOREIGN>  verbi compositi
