 <NOTE N="26." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Et misiteum ad domum ejus dicens: ne in hunc victum eas, ne cuiquam dicas in hoc vico.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 26." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">mannhun qiþais</HI> ] ¶ gr.— <HI REND="ITALIC">þamma</HI> ] J. St. †
