 <NOTE N="27." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Et exiit Iesus et discipuli ejus in vicos Caesariae hujus Filippi, et in via interrogavit discipulos suos dicens ad
eos: quem me dicunt homines esse?</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 27." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">usïddja</HI> ] St. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">ussïddja.</HI></NOTE>  jah aftra gasatiþs varþ jah gasaw bairhtaba allans. jah ïnsandida ïna du garda ïs qiþands. ni
