vehsa kaisarias þizos filippaus jah ana viga frah siponjans seinans qiþands du ïm. wana mik qiþand
 <NOTE N="28." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Verum ii responderunt: Iohannem hunc Baptistam; et alii Heliam;
quidam autem unum profetarum.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 28." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þan</HI> ] St. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">þain.</HI></NOTE>  mans visan. ïþ eis andhofun. ïohannen þana daupjand. jah anþarai helian. sumaih þan ainana praufete.
 <NOTE N="29." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Et is dixit ad eos: at vos quem me dicitis esse? Respondens
autem Petrus dixit ad eum: tu es Christus.</NOTE>  jah ïs qaþ du ïm. aþþan jus wana mik qiþiþ visan. andhafjands þan paitrus qaþ du ïmma þu ïs
 <NOTE N="30." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Et interdixit iis, ut cuiquam non dicerent de eo.</NOTE> <NOTE N="31." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Et coepit docere eos, quod debet Filius hominis multum pati, et rejici debet ab his natu maximis et his summis
sacerdotibus et scribis, et occidi et post tres dies exsurgere.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 31." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">skulds ïst</HI> ] Z. glossam ad  <HI REND="ITALIC">skal</HI>  esse dicens
