 <NOTE N="3." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0553" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0553"></COL> Et vestes ejus factae-sunt splendentes, albae uti nix, tales, uti fullo in terra
non potest dealbare.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 3." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0554" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0554"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">glitmunjandeins</HI> ] J. St. B. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">glitmunjande
