 <COL N="0555"></COL> <NOTE N="6." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0555" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0555"></COL> Non enim scivit, quid loqueretur; fuerunt enim exterriti.</NOTE> <NOTE N="7." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0555" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0555"></COL> Et facta est
