 <NOTE N="8." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0555" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0555"></COL> Et subito
circumspicientes non amplius quemquam viderunt, nisi Iesum unum cum se.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 8." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0555" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0555"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ni þanaseiþs</HI> ] St. Z. † jct.— <HI REND="ITALIC">ainohun</HI> ] sic
