regnum Dei ire.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="X, 24." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0561" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0561"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ïm</HI> ] J. St. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">ïn.—hunjandam</HI> ] sic cod. Arg.
