 <NOTE N="12." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589"></COL> Et hoc vobis signum: invenitis infantem involutum et positum in praesepio.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="II, 12." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0590" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0590"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">jah</HI> ] sec. et,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr.</NOTE>  xristus frauja ïn baurg daveidis. jah þata ïzvis taikns. bigitid barn bivundan jah galagid ïn uzetin.
