 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>qeouð.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <NOTE N="47." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665"></COL> Amen, amen dico vobis: qui credit ad me, habet vitam aeternam.</NOTE>  attin jah ganam. gaggiþ du mis. ni þatei attan sewi was. nibai saei ïst fram attin. sa saw attan. amen
