ïn sunjai ni gastoþ. unte nist sunja ïn ïmma. þan rodeiþ liugn. us seinaim rodeiþ. unte liugnja ïst
 <NOTE N="45." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> Verum ego,
quod veritatem locutus-sum, non creditis mihi.</NOTE> <NOTE N="VIII, 45." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">rodida</HI> ] locutus sum, gr. omn.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>lalwð</FOREIGN>   <CITN>(vid.
ad vs. 26)</CITN> , cf. ad L. X, 19.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="46." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> Quis vestrum increpat me ob peccatum? Dum veritatem
