 <NOTE N="49." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> Respondit Iesus: ego daemonem non habeo, sed honoro patrem meum, et vos inhonoratis
me.</NOTE>  ïs þu jah unhulpon habais. andhof ïesus. ïk unhulþon ni haba ak svera attan meinana. jah
 <NOTE N="50." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> Ego non quaero gloriam meam; est qui quaerit et judicat.</NOTE> <NOTE N="VIII, 50." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ïk</HI> ] Ulf. c. codd.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dhv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <NOTE N="51." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> Amen, amen dico vobis, si
