 <NOTE N="54." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> Respondit Iesus: si ego exalto me ipsum, haec gloria mea non quidquam
est; est pater meus, qui exaltat me, quem vos dicitis, quod Deus noster est.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 54." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">unsar</HI> ] noster, gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJmwðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  praufeteis gadauþnodedun. wana þuk silban taujis þu. andhof ïesus. jabai ïk hauhja mik silban. so
