 <NOTE N="IX, 1." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> Et transiens observavit hominem caecum a nativitate.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="2." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0675" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0675"></COL> Tunc interrogarunt eum discipuli ejus dicentes:
