 <NOTE N="12." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0677" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0677"></COL> Dixerunt autem ad eum: ubi est hic? Verum is dixit: non scio.</NOTE> <NOTE N="IX, 12." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0677" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0677"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ïþ ïs</HI> ] verum is,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="13." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0677" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0677"></COL> Adducunt eum ad Farisaeos hunc, qui fuit caecus.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 13." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0677" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0677"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">gatiuhand</HI> ] St. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">gatjuhand.—saei</HI> ] Ulf.  <SUP>o</SUP> 
