dixit etiam his: lutum posuit mihi ad oculos et ablui et video.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 15." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0678" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0678"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">fareisaieis</HI> ] sic cod. Arg.; J. St. Hz. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">fareisaeis.—jah</HI> ] sec. etiam,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn.</NOTE>  blinds. vasuh þan sabbato. þan þata fani gavaurhta ïesus jah uslauk ïmma augona. aftra þan
frehun ïna jah þai fareisaieis. waiva ussaw. ïþ ïs qaþ jah þaim. fani galagida mis ana augona jah
 <NOTE N="16." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0677" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0677"></COL> Dixerunt autem quidam horum Farisaeorum:
