 <NOTE N="38." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0689" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0689"></COL> Ut hoc verbum Esaiae profetae impleretur, quod dixit: domine,
quis credidit auditui nostro, et brachium domini, cui detectum fuit.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XII, 38." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0690" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0690"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">esaeiïns</HI> ] St. Hz. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">esaejins.</HI></NOTE>  ïmma. ei þata vaurd esaeiïns praufetaus usfullnodedi. þatei qaþ. frauja. was galaubida hauseinai
 <NOTE N="39." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0689" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0689"></COL> Itaque non potuerunt credere,
 <COL N="0691"></COL> nam iterum dixit Esaias:</NOTE>  unsarai. jah arms fraujins wamma andhuliþs varþ. duþþe ni mahtedun galaubjan. unte aftra
 <COL N="0691"></COL> <NOTE N="40." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0691" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0691"></COL> obcaecavit eorum oculos et induravit eorum corda, ut non viderent
oculis et intelligerent corde et converterent et sanarem eos.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XII, 40." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0691" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0691"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">hairtona</HI> ] corda, gr. omn.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kardivan.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  qaþ esaeias. gablindida ïze augona jah gadaubida ïze hairtona. ei ni gaumidedeina augam jah
