et  <HI REND="ITALIC">i</HI>  modo se omisisse putans, alterum  <HI REND="ITALIC">n</HI>  non repeteret.
Dativus utique in  <HI REND="ITALIC">n</HI>  desinit:  <HI REND="ITALIC">synagogein</HI>  L IV,
16, 20, 28;  <HI REND="ITALIC">synagogen</HI>  Mc. I, 23, 29.</NOTE>  rodida bi ïna. þanuh þan sveþauh jah us þaim reikam managai galaubidedun du ïmma. akei faura
