 <NOTE N="49." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0691" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0691"></COL> Nam
ego ex me ipso non locutus-sum, sed qui misit me pater, hic mihi praeceptum de (dit)—</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XII, 49." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0692" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0692"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">at..</HI> ] J. e conjectura complet  <HI REND="ITALIC">atgaf.</HI></NOTE>  spedistin daga. unte ïk us mis silbin ni rodida. ak saei sandida mik atta. sah mis anabuns at . . . ——qaþ.
 <NOTE N="XIII, 11." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0691" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0691"></COL> —dixit:
non omnes mundi estis.</NOTE> <NOTE N="12." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0691" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0691"></COL> Cum autem lavit pedes eorum et cepit vestes suas, accumbens iterum dixit
