 <NOTE N="13." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0691" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0691"></COL> Vos vocatis me, magister et dominus? Bene dicitis, sum enim;</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIII, 13." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0692" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0692"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">laisareis</HI> ] cod. Arg. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">laisareisareis,</HI>  non
uti Ih. Z. dicunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">laisareissareis,</HI>  cf. ad IX, 41.— <HI REND="ITALIC">frauja</HI> ]
Ulf.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  aftra qaþ du ïm. vitudu. wa gatavida ïzvis. jus vopeid mik. laisareis jah frauja. vaila qiþiþ. ïm auk
