igitur lavi vobis pedes, dominus et magister, etiam vos debetis vobis invicem lavare pedes.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIII, 14." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0692" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0692"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">nu</HI> ] Ulf.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejgwv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  jabai nu usþvoh ïzvis fotuns frauja jah laisareis. jah jus skuluþ ïzvis misso þvahan fotuns.
 <NOTE N="15." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0691" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0691"></COL> Ad exemplum
enim dedi vobis, ut sicut ego feci vobis, sic vos faciatis.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIII, 15." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0692" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0692"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">sva</HI> ] sic, gr. omn.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiv,</FOREIGN>  vid. ad XV, 9.</NOTE> <NOTE N="16." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0691" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0691"></COL> Amen, amen dico vobis, non-est servus
