 <NOTE N="30." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0693" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0693"></COL> Ubi accepit hunc panem
ille, statim ivit foras. Fuit autem nox.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIII, 30." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0693" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0693"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">biþe</HI> ] Ulf. c. cod. r. ap. Mi.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouøn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  aiþþau þaim unledam ei wa gibau. biþe andnam þana hlaib jains. suns galaiþ ut. vasuh þan nahts.
 <NOTE N="31." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0693" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0693"></COL> Cum ivit foras, dixit tum Iesus: nunc glorificatus factus-est
filius hominis et Deus altatus est in eo.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIII, 31." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0693" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0693"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þan</HI> ] sec. tum,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn. nec in gothica
versione recte se habere existimamus, nam correlationem
particularum, quae in tam minutis sermonis
