 <NOTE N="XV, 1." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0697" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0697"></COL> Ego sum vitis haec vera, et pater meus operarius est.</NOTE>  sva tauja. urreisiþ. gaggam þaþro. ïk ïm veinatriu þata sunjeino. jah atta meins vaurstvja ïst.
