 <NOTE N="5." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0697" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0697"></COL> Ego sum haec vitis, verum vos palmites; qui manet in me et ego in eo, sic fert fructum
multum, quod sine me non potestis facere non quidquam.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XV, 5." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0697" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0697"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ïþ</HI> ] verum,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn.— <HI REND="ITALIC">sva</HI> ] sic, gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oußtoû,</FOREIGN> 
