in praetorium iterum Pilatus et vocavit Iesum dixitque ei: tu es rex Iudaeorum?</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XVIII, 33." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0708" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0708"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">galaiþ</HI> ] Ulf.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouøn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  bandvjands wileikamma dauþau skulda gasviltan. galaiþ ïn praitauria aftra peilatus jah vopida ïesu
