 <NOTE N="9." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0709" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0709"></COL> et ivit in praetorium iterum et dixit ad Iesum: unde es tu? Verum Iesus responsum non dedit ei.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIX, 9." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0709" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0709"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">andavaurdi</HI> ] cur in hac forma F. et Z. offensi
