 <COL N="0710"></COL> †  <HI REND="ITALIC">þu.</HI></NOTE>  ïmma. þaruh qaþ ïmma peilatus. du mis ni rodeis. niu vaist þatei valdufni aih ushramjan þuk jah
 <NOTE N="11." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0709" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0709"></COL> Respondit Iesus: non haberes potestatum ullam in me, nisi esset tibi tradita
