XIV, 12, 19; Cor. II, V, 15, all.)</CITN> , quod gr. omn. ibi
habent.— <HI REND="ITALIC">haituda harinondei</HI> ] ¶ gr. omn.— <HI REND="ITALIC">jabai</HI> ]
