 <NOTE N="15." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0711" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0711"></COL> Quod operor, non intelligo; nam non quod volo, facio, sed quod odi, hoc facio.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VII, 15." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0712" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0712"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þatei</HI> ] Goth.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gavr.</FOREIGN> — <HI REND="ITALIC">viljau</HI> ] Goth. c.
codd.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touðto.</FOREIGN></NOTE> <NOTE N="16." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0711" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0711"></COL> Verum
