bonum, sed quod non volo, malum facio.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VII, 19." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0712" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0712"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ubil</HI> ] Goth.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touðto.</FOREIGN></NOTE> <NOTE N="20." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0711" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0711"></COL> Si igitur quod non volo ego, hoc facio, amplius non ego operor
id, sed quod habitat in me peccatum.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VII, 20." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0712" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0712"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">bauïþ</HI> ] vid. ad vs. 18.</NOTE>  goþ ni bigita. unte ni þatei viljau vaurkja goþ ak þatei ni viljau ubil tauja. jabai nu þatei ni viljau
