malum.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VII, 21." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0712" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0712"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">goþ taujan</HI> ] ¶ gr. omn.— <HI REND="ITALIC">atïst ubil</HI> ] ¶ gr.
