 <NOTE N="22." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0711" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0711"></COL> Laetus sum enim lege Dei secundum hunc internum hominem;</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VII, 22." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0712" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0712"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ïnnumin</HI> ] vid. ad Coloss. I, 29.</NOTE> <NOTE N="23." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0711" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0711"></COL> at video alteram legem in
