 <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mevn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  dauþaus þis. aviliudo guþa þairh ïesu xristu fraujan unsarana. jau nu silba ïk skalkino gahugdai
