utique nunc damnationis his in Christo Iesu, non ambulantibus secundum carnem;</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 1." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0713" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0713"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þannu nu</HI> ] Cast. † jct., uti hic vir doctus
