 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>twðn ajgaqwðn eærgwn ajllaú twðn kakwðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  guþs garaideinai andstoþ. ïþ þai andstandandans silbans vis vargiþa nimand. þai auk reiks ni sind
