dies propinquavit; abigimus nunc opera tenebrarum, verum induimus arma lucis,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIII, 12." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0723" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0723"></COL> exstant in cod. A et de his inde ab
