 <NOTE N="12." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0733" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0733"></COL> At peccantes contra fratres,
 <COL N="0735"></COL> percutientes eorum conscientiam imbecillam, contra Christum peccatis.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 12." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0734" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0734"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">aþþan</HI> ] Goth.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouåtw.</FOREIGN> — <HI REND="ITALIC">broþruns</HI> ] Goth.
c. cod. G  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  þize xristus gasvalt. aþþan fravaurkjandans viþra broþruns slahandans ïze gahugd siuka du xristau fravaurkeiþ.
 <COL N="0735"></COL> <NOTE N="13." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> Ideo si cibus sollicitat fratrem,
non edo carnem unquam, ut non sollicitem fratrem meum.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="VIII, 13." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">broþar</HI> ] pr. Goth. c. codd.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mouð.</FOREIGN> — <HI REND="ITALIC">gamarzjau</HI> ]
gr. omn. post  <HI REND="ITALIC">meinana.</HI></NOTE>  vaurkeiþ. duþþe jabai mats gamarzeiþ broþar. ni matja mimz aiv. ei ni gamarzjau broþar meinana.
 <NOTE N="IX, 1." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> Nonne sum apostolus? non sum
liber? nonne Iesum Christum dominum vidi? nonne opus meum vos estis in domino?</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 1." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">niu</HI> ] pr. sic cod. A; Cast. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">nih.—apaustaulus—freis</HI> ]
¶ gr.— <HI REND="ITALIC">fraujan</HI> ] Goth.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hJmwðn</FOREIGN> — <HI REND="ITALIC">vaurstv</HI> ]
cod. A et Cast. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">vausstv.</HI></NOTE>  niu ïm apaustaulus. ni ïm freis. niu ïesu xristau fraujan saw. niu vaurstv meinata jus sijuþ ïn fraujin.
 <NOTE N="2." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> Si aliis non
sum apostolus, tamen vobis sum, nam sigillum mei apostolatus vos estis.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 2." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">aiþþau</HI> ] vid. ad II, IV, 16.— <HI REND="ITALIC">sijuþ</HI> ] Goth.
e. codd.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn kurivwé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  jabai anþaraim ni ïm apaustaulus. aiþþau ïzvis ïm. unte sigljo meinaizos apaustauleins jus sijuþ.
 <NOTE N="3." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> Mea defensio contra hos me
petentes hoc-est.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 3." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þat-ïst</HI> ] exemplum constructionis germanicarum
linguarum propriae, cujus generis aliud ad Mc.
VI, 3 adnotavimus.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="4." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> Num non habemus potestatem edere et bibere?</NOTE>  meina andahafts viþra þans mik ussokjandans þat-ïst. ïbai ni habam valdufni matjan jah drigkan.
 <NOTE N="5." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> num non habemus potestatem sororem
uxorem circumducere, sicut hi alii apostoli et fratres domini et Cefae?</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 5." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">svasve</HI> ] Gothic. codd.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  ïbai ni habam valdufni svistar qinon bitiuhan svasve þai anþarai apaustauleis jah broþrjus fraujins
 <NOTE N="6." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> An unusne ego et Barnabas
non habemus potestatem ad non operandum?</NOTE> <NOTE N="7." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> Quis militat propriis stipendiis unquam? quis
plantat vitem et fructum horum non edat? quis pascit gregem et lac hujus gregis non edat?</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 7." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">satjiþ</HI> ] sic cod. A; Cast. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">sateiþ.—akran</HI> ]
fructum, gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejk touð karpouð.</FOREIGN> — <HI REND="ITALIC">matjai</HI> ] pr. Goth. c.
