secundum hominem hoc dico aut etiam lex hoc dicit?</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 8." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">mannan</HI> ] sic cod. A; Cast. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">manna.—aiþþau</HI> ]
Goth.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oujciv,</FOREIGN>  qua particula omissa Goth.
sensui male consuluit; sunt quidem codd., qui etiam
omittant, ii autem pro ea  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eij</FOREIGN>  particulam habent.</NOTE> <NOTE N="9." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> In lege enim Mosis scriptum est: ne alliges-os
bovi trituranti, non quod de bovibus—</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 9." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">vitoda</HI> ] gr. post  <HI REND="ITALIC">mosezis.—þriskaidai</HI> ] sic
in cod. A scriptum esse, Cast. affirmat; primum autem
