 <NOTE N="21." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> his legem-non-habentibus ut legem-non-habens, non existens lege liber Dei, sed in legem Christi,
ut lucrer legem-non-habentes;</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IX, 21." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0736" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0736"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">vitodis laus</HI> ] Cast. ÷ jct.— <HI REND="ITALIC">ïn vitoþ</HI> ] in
