 <NOTE N="23." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> Hoc autem facio propter evangelium, ut particeps ejus fiam.</NOTE>  sve unmahteigs ei unmahteigans gageiggaidedjau. alaim vas all ei waiva sumans ganasjau. þatuþþan
 <NOTE N="24." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0735" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0735"></COL> Nonne scitis, quod hi in stadium currentes omnes currunt, verum unus accipit praemium; sic curratis,
