 <NOTE N="X, 1." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0737" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0737"></COL> Non volo vos inscios, fratres, quod patres nostri omnes sub nube fuerunt et omnes mare transierunt,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="X, 1." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0737" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0737"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">viljau</HI> ] Goth.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gavr.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  vairþau. ni viljau ïzvis unvitans. broþrjus. þatei attans unsarai allai uf milhmin vesun jah
