VI, 16.</NOTE>  ïggqara ni parf. ak mais filu þaiei þugkjand liþive leikis lasivostai visan þaurfta sind ——aiþþau
 <NOTE N="XIII, 1." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0741" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0741"></COL> —aut tintinnabulum tinniens;</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIII, 1." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0741" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0741"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">klismo klismjandei</HI> ] sic cod. A; Cast. †
 <HI REND="ITALIC">klismoklis moandei;</HI>  Mssm.  <CITN>(Skeir. Gloss. p. 144)</CITN>  †
