gr. omn.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>pavnta</FOREIGN>  ad  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>musthvria</FOREIGN>  pertinens et post  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>musthvria</FOREIGN> 
quidem.— <HI REND="ITALIC">jah</HI> ] ult. Goth.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejavn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  klismo klismjandei. jah jabai habau praufetjans jah vitjau allaize runos jah all kunþi
 <NOTE N="3." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0741" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0741"></COL> et si cibum-distribuam omnes facultates meas et
si dem corpus meum, ut urar, verum amorem habeam, non quidquam utilitatis mihi faciam.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XIII, 3." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0742" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0742"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ei gabrannjaidau</HI> ] cod. A marg.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ei wop . . . </HI> 
