 <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dev.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  ni ufblesada. ni aiviskoþ. ni sokeiþ sein ain. ni ïngramjada nih mitoþ ubil nih faginoþ
 <NOTE N="7." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0741" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0741"></COL> congaudet veritati, omne perfert, omne credit, omne sperat, omne sustinet.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="8." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0741" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0741"></COL> Amor
