 <NOTE N="27." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0743" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0743"></COL> Sive lingua quis loquatur secundum duos, aut maxime tres et——</NOTE>  razda habaiþ. allata du timreinai vairþai. jaþþe razdai was rodjai bi tvans aiþþau maist þrins jah——aþþan
