in primis, quod accepi, quod Christus mortuus-est pro peccatis nostris, secundum libros,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="XV, 3." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0743" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0743"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þatei</HI> ] Goth.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  galaubideduþ. atgaf auk ïzvis in frumistjam. þatei andnam ei xristus gasvalt faur fravaurhtins unsaros
