du kaurinþium ·b· meliþ ïst us filippai makidonais.</CAPTION></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0779" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0779">DU GALATIM. <NOTE TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=N COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> Inscript. Epistola abrupte incipit sine titulo.  <ED>CAST.</ED></NOTE></HEAD> <COL N="0779"></COL> <P COM="0779"><NOTE N="I, 1." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> Pavlus, apostolus non ab hominibus, neque per hominem, sed per Iesum Christum et Deum patrem,
qui resuscitavit eum e mortuis,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="I, 1-II, 17" TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> leguntur in cod. B et I, 22—II, 8 etiam
in cod. A.</NOTE>  Pavlus apaustaulus ni af mannam nih þairh mannan ak þairh ïesu xristu jah guþ attan. ïze urraisida
 <NOTE N="2." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> et hi cum me omnes fratres ecclesiis Galatiae.</NOTE> , <NOTE N="3." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> Gratia vobis et pax
a Deo patre et domino nostro Iesu Christo,</NOTE>  ïna us dauþaim. jah þai miþ mis allai broþrjus aikklesjom galatiais. ansts ïzvis jah gavairþi fram
 <NOTE N="4." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> qui dedit se ipsum pro peccatis nostris, ut liberaret nos ex
praesenti aevo malo secundum voluntatem Dei et patris nostri,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="I, 4." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">andvairþin</HI> ] sic legendum est, nam  <HI REND="ITALIC">anavairþin,</HI> 
quod cod. B praebet et Cast. recepit, cum  <HI REND="ITALIC">futuro</HI>  significet,
sensum pervertit;  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejnestwvû</FOREIGN>  per  <HI REND="ITALIC">andvairþs</HI>  convertitur
Rom. VIII, 38; Cor. I, VII, 26.</NOTE>  guþa attin jah fraujin unsaramma ïesu xristau. ïzei gaf sik silban faur fravaurhtins unsaros ei uslausidedi
 <NOTE N="5." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> cui gloria in saecula, amen.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="I, 5." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">aivam</HI> ] Goth. c. codd.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>twðn aijwvnwn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  uns us þamma andvairþin aiva ubilin bi viljin guþs jah attins unsaris. þammei vulþus du
 <NOTE N="6." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> Miror,
quod sicut celeriter avertimini ab hoc vocante vos in gratiam Christi ad aliud evangelium,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="I, 6." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">svasve</HI> ] sicut, sic cod. B mendose pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">sva</HI> 
( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouåtw</FOREIGN> ).</NOTE>  aivam amen. sildaleikja ei svasve sprauto afvandjanda af þamma laþondin ïzvis ïn anstai xristaus du
 <NOTE N="7." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> quod non-est
aliud, nisi quidam sunt hi conturbantes vos et volentes pervertere evangelium Christi.——</NOTE>  anþaramma aivaggelja. þatei nist anþar. alja sumai sind þai drobjandans ïzvis jah viljandans ïnvandjan
 <NOTE N="20." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> At quod
scribo vobis, ecce in facie Dei, quod non mentior.</NOTE> , <NOTE N="21." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> Deinde veni in regionem Sorae et Ciliciae,</NOTE>  aivaggeli xristaus.——aþþan þatei melja ïzvis. sai ïn andvairþja guþs ei ni liuga. þapro qam
