 <NOTE N="2." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0791" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0791"></COL> Gratia vobis et pax a Deo patre nostro et domino Iesu Christo.</NOTE>  triggvaim ïn xristau ïesu. ansts ïzvis jah gavairþi fram guþa attin unsaramma jah fraujin ïesu
