c. codd.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aujtouð.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  vistai barna hatizis svasve jah þai anþarai. ïþ guþ gabeigs visands ïn armahairtein ïn þizos managons
