 <NOTE N="6." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0793" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0793"></COL> et conresuscitati et concollocati in coelestibus in Christo Iesu,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="II, 6." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0793" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0793"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">miþurraisidai—miþgasatidai</HI> ] conresuscitati—concollocati,
