 <NOTE N="20." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0799" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0799"></COL> Verum vos non sic accepistis Christum;</NOTE> <NOTE N="21." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0799" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0799"></COL> si tamen eum audivistis et
in eo edocti estis, sicut est veritas in Iesu,</NOTE>  ïþ jus ni sva ganemuþ xristu. jabai sveþauh ïna hausideduþ jah in ïmmai uslaisidai sijuþ. svasve
 <NOTE N="22." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0799" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0799"></COL> ut deponatis vos secundum primam conversionem hunc veterem
hominem, hunc corruptibilem secundum cupiditates deceptionis.</NOTE>  ïst sunja ïn ïesu. ei aflagjaiþ jus bi frumin usmeta þana fairnjan mannan þana riurjan bi lustum
 <NOTE N="23." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0799" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0799"></COL> Re autem novetis spiritum mentis
vestrae</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IV, 23." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0800" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0800"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">anuþ-þan niujaiþ</HI> ] vid. ad Mc. XIV, 44.</NOTE> <NOTE N="24." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0799" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0799"></COL> et induatis hunc novum hominem, hunc secundum Deum creatum in justitia et sanctitate
