 <NOTE N="25." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0799" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0799"></COL> Propter quod deponentes mendacium loquamini veritatem quisque cum propinquo suo, nam
estis alter alterius membrum.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IV, 25." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0800" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0800"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">sijuþ</HI> ] estis, cod. A c. gr. omn,  <HI REND="ITALIC">sijum</HI> 
