 <NOTE N="27." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0799" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0799"></COL> ne date locum diabolo.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="IV, 27." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0800" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0800"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ni gibiþ</HI> ] ne date, cod. A et Cast. c. gr.
