 <NOTE N="7." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0801" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0801"></COL> Ne fiatis nunc socii iis.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="V, 7." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0802" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0802"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">vairþaiþ nu</HI> ] ¶ gr. omn.</NOTE> <NOTE N="8." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0801" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0801"></COL> Fuistis
enim aliquando tenebrae, verum nunc lumen in domino, uti filii luminis ambuletis.</NOTE>  þairh þoei qimiþ hatis guþs ana sunum ungalaubeinais. ni vairþaiþ nu gadailans ïm. vesuþ auk
 <NOTE N="9." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0801" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0801"></COL> At fructus luminis
est in omni probitate et justitia et veritate.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="V, 9." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0802" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0802"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ïst</HI> ] est.  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn.</NOTE>  suman riqiz. ïþ nu liuhap ïn fraujin. sve barna liuhadis gaggaiþ. aþþan akran liuhadis ïst ïn allai
