resurrectionem e mortuis,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="III, 11." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">waiva</HI> ] sic codd.; Specim. †  <HI REND="ITALIC">wa sva.—us</HI> ]
e,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr.</NOTE>  kunnan ïna jah maht usstassais ïs jah gamainduþ þulaine ïs. miþkauriþs vas dauþau ïs. ei waiva gaqimau
 <NOTE N="12." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> non quod jam acceperim aut jam justus judicatus sim, at ego sequor ut
