 <NOTE N="13." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> Fratres, ego me ipsum non quidem puto capere,</NOTE>   <NOTE N="III, 13." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0810" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0810"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þau</HI> ] quidem,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn.; cod. A  <HI REND="ITALIC">nauh</HI>  c.
codd. iis qui  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouæpw</FOREIGN>  legunt.</NOTE>  afargagga ei gafahau. ïn þammei gafahans varþ fram xristau. broþrjus ik mik silban ni þau man
 <NOTE N="14." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> at unum
quidem horum retro obliviscens, verum ad haec quae ante sunt, me extendens secundum scopum sequor
