 <NOTE N="16." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> At tamen, ad quod pervenimus,
ut idem sentiamus et idem cogitemus, eadam ire regula.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="III, 16." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0810" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0810"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ei—fraþjaima</HI> ] ut—cogitemus,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr.;
caeterum vid. ad Cor. I, IX, 25.— <HI REND="ITALIC">samon—garaideinai</HI> ]
haec in cod. B (non A, uti Cast. adnotat) et
apud Cast. omissa e cod. A hic posuimus; gr.  <SUP>o</SUP>   <HI REND="ITALIC">garaideinai.</HI></NOTE>  sijaima fullavitans. þata hugjaima jah jabai wa aljaleikos hugjiþ. jah þata ïzvis guþ andhuljiþ. aþþan
sveþauh du þammei gasnevum ei samo hugjaima jah samo fraþjaima. samon gaggan garaideinai.
 <NOTE N="17." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> Coimitatores mei fiatis, fratres, et observate
vobis hos sic euntes, sicut habetis exemplum nos.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="III, 17." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0810" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0810"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">miþgaleikondans meinai</HI> ] vid. ad Cor. I, XI,
1.— <HI REND="ITALIC">jah mundoþ</HI> ] cod. A  <HI REND="ITALIC">jam-mundoþ.</HI></NOTE>  miþgaleikondans meinai vairþaiþ broþrjus jah mundoþ ïzvis þans sva gaggandans svasve habaiþ
 <NOTE N="18." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> Nam multi eunt, quos saepe dixi vobis, verum
nunc etiam flens dico hos osores crucis Christi,</NOTE>  frisaht unsis. unte managai gaggand. þanzei ufta qaþ ïzvis ïþ nu jah gretands qiþa þans
 <NOTE N="19." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> quorum finis fit perditio; horum Deus venter est et
gloria in dedecore eorum, qui terrestria cogitant;</NOTE>   <NOTE N="III, 19." TYPE="Annotationes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0810" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0810"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">þizeei</HI> ] cod. A  <HI REND="ITALIC">þizeiei.—vairþiþ</HI> ] fit,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr.
omn.— <HI REND="ITALIC">þize</HI> ] sic cod. B; cod. A et Cast. c. gr. omn.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">þizeei</HI>  (quorum).— <HI REND="ITALIC">ïst</HI> ] est,  <SUP>o</SUP>  gr. omn.— <HI REND="ITALIC">vulþus</HI> ]
cod. A  <HI REND="ITALIC">vulþaus,</HI>  vid. ad Mc. VII, 32.</NOTE>  fijands galgins xristaus. þizeei andeis vairþiþ fralusts. þize guþ vamba ïst jah vulþus ïn skandai
 <NOTE N="20." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0809" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0809"></COL> verum nostra habitatio in coelis est, unde etiam servatorem
