 <SUP>o</SUP>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJmwðn.</FOREIGN> — <HI REND="ITALIC">leika</HI> ] corpora, gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>nohvmata.</FOREIGN></NOTE>  bidos ïzvaros kunþos sijaina at guþa. jah gavairþi guþs. þatei ufarïst all ahane. fastaiþ hairtona jah
 <NOTE N="8." TYPE="Interpretatio" ANCHORED=Y COM="0811" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0811"></COL> Hoc aliud, fratres, omne quod est verum, omne quod verecundum, omne quod justum, omne
