ïm. ak mais sildaleikjandans <NOTE N="13" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0877" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0877"></COL> M.  <HI REND="ITALIC">silkaleikjandans.</HI></NOTE>  fraujins laisein svikunþaba ïn allaim alamannam fauravisan
