in genere minus frequenter quam  <HI REND="ITALIC">i</HI>  et  <HI REND="ITALIC">u</HI>  occurrens:</P> <P COM="0916"><HI REND="ITALIC">a</HI> ) Medio:  <HI REND="ITALIC">berun, blesan, gebun, gredus, qens, heþjo,
