mes, andasets, lev, newa,</HI></P> <P COM="0917"><HI REND="ITALIC">b</HI> ) Fine:  <HI REND="ITALIC">ne, þe, we, sve, simle, svare, unte, þande,
hidre, jaindre, wadre, bisunjane,</HI>  et in genit. plur.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">fiske, vaurde,</HI>  etc.</P> <P COM="0917"><HI REND="ITALIC">c</HI> ) Aliis autem vocalibus  <HI REND="ITALIC">e</HI>  nunquam praeponitur,
