lat.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ae: kreks</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Graikovû,</FOREIGN>  Graecus.»</P> <P COM="0917">3) Jam supra fuit animadversum  <CITN>(§ 23 annot. 2)</CITN> ,
