frigus.</P> <P COM="0953">«Annotatio 1.—Huc pertinent alia vocabula, de
quibus in incerto est utrum sint masculina vel neutra,
quae vid. § 66 annot. 2.</P> <P COM="0953">«Annotatio 2.—Ad hanc nostram declinationem
referendum est secundum formam etiam  <HI REND="ITALIC">guþ</HI>  Deus,
cum anomalis gen.  <HI REND="ITALIC">guþs,</HI>  nom. plur.  <HI REND="ITALIC">guda,</HI>  licet ab
Ulfila, influente probabiliter doctrina christiana (coll.
gloss. V.  <HI REND="ITALIC">unhulþo</HI> ) in sing. ut masc. usurpetur.</P> <P COM="0953">«Annotatio 3.—De genitivo plur.  <HI REND="ITALIC">dalei</HI>  Luc. III, 5
loco  <HI REND="ITALIC">dale</HI>  et  <HI REND="ITALIC">spilli</HI>  Tit. I, 14 loco  <HI REND="ITALIC">spille,</HI>  vid. ubi de sonis
§§ 23, 4; 30, 3.</P> <P COM="0953">«Annotatio 4.—Cum  <HI REND="ITALIC">munþs</HI>  os, oris, masc. occurrit
etiam  <HI REND="ITALIC">munþ</HI>  neutr. Cor. II, VI, 11.</P> <P COM="0953">«Annotatio 5.—Loco  <HI REND="ITALIC">brawa</HI>  Cor. I, XV, 52 a neutr.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">braw</HI>  forsan  <HI REND="ITALIC">brawai</HI>  a fem.  <HI REND="ITALIC">brawa</HI>  legendum est.»</P> <TBL COL="03" WIDTH1=10 WIDTH2=10 WIDTH3=10 COM="0953"><HEAD COM="0953">§ 70.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>b.</FOREIGN>  Forma radicalis  <HI REND="ITALIC">-ja: KUNJA.</HI></HEAD> <HR><H N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="CENTRE">Sing.</H> <H N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="CENTRE">Plur.</H></HR> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Nom.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kuni</HI>  genus</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kunja</HI>  genera</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Voc.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kuni</HI>  genus</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kunja</HI>  genera</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Acc.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kuni</HI>  genus</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kunja</HI>  genera</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Dat.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kunja</HI>  generi</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kunjam</HI>  generibus</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Gen.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kunjis</HI>  generis</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">kunge</HI>  generum.</C></R></TBL> <P COM="0953">Sic declinantur:  <HI REND="ITALIC">aglaiti</HI>  impudicitia,  <HI REND="ITALIC">azeti</HI>  deliciae,
