VII, 12, acc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">daubata</HI>  Mc. VIII, 17,  <HI REND="ITALIC">mikilata</HI>  Mc. XIV,
15,  <HI REND="ITALIC">vairþata</HI>  Luc. III, 8,  <HI REND="ITALIC">juggata</HI>  Mc. II, 22,  <HI REND="ITALIC">svaleikata</HI> 
Mth. IX, 8,  <HI REND="ITALIC">hauhata</HI>  Luc. IV, 5, cum  <HI REND="ITALIC">all</HI>  Mth. VII,
19; Phil. III, 8,  <HI REND="ITALIC">mikil</HI>  Mc. IV, 39, 41.  <HI REND="ITALIC">wirþ</HI>  Cor. I, XVI,
