FT"><HI REND="ITALIC">lagjands</HI></C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Pass.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">sokiþs</HI></C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><HI REND="ITALIC">lagiþs</HI></C></R></TBL> <P COM="0991">Ut  <HI REND="ITALIC">sokjan</HI>  conjugantur:  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>a</FOREIGN> ) verba vocalem naturaliter
longam vel diphthongum in syllaba radicali habentia:</P> <P COM="0991"><HI REND="ITALIC">aa) levjan</HI>  tradere,  <HI REND="ITALIC">skevjan</HI>  iterfacere,  <HI REND="ITALIC">gatevjan</HI>  ordinare,
