(a  <HI REND="ITALIC">niutan</HI> );</P> <P COM="1012"><HI REND="ITALIC">dd</HI> ) E participio pass. nulla certo derivantur.</P> <P COM="1012"><HI REND="ITALIC">b</HI> ) E verbis secundae conjugationis:  <HI REND="ITALIC">usskavs</HI>  (a
