dauþans ni urreisand, nih xristus urrais;</HI></P> <P COM="1051"><HI REND="ITALIC">b</HI> ) Post particulas temporales;</P> <P COM="1051"><HI REND="ITALIC">c</HI> ) In interrogationibus indirectis: Joan. IX, 21
 <HI REND="ITALIC">waiva nu saiwiþ, ni vitum;</HI></P> <P COM="1051"><HI REND="ITALIC">d</HI> ) In oratione obliqua: Luc. VIII, 47  <HI REND="ITALIC">gasaiwandei
so qino, þatei ni galaugnida.</HI></P> <P COM="1051">Quid fusius de his casibus et quomodo praecipue
in  <HI REND="ITALIC">a), c</HI> ) et  <HI REND="ITALIC">d</HI> ) saepissime conjunctivus adhibeatur,
vid. infra ubi de sententia composita agitur.</P> <CAPTION COM="1051">§ 185. CONJUNCTIVUS possibilitatem significat.
1) Jam vero in sententiis simplicibus possibile
enuntiari potest:</CAPTION> <P COM="1051"><HI REND="ITALIC">a</HI> ) Ut aliquid  <HI REND="ITALIC">desideratum (optativum</HI> ): Rom. XV, 5
