 <COL N="1052"></COL> videamus, germ.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lasst uns!</HI>  vid. infra § 186, 4;</P> <P COM="1052"><HI REND="ITALIC">d</HI> ) Ut aliquid  <HI REND="ITALIC">debitum;</HI>  huc praecipue pertinet tertia
persona, quae pro immediato imperativo gothice
usurpatur, vid. infra § 186, 3;</P> <P COM="1052"><HI REND="ITALIC">e</HI> ) In genere ut aliquid, cujus existentia a futuro
