(vel nonne dare debemus?); Joan. III, 4  <HI REND="ITALIC">ïbai mag
manna alþeis visands ïn vamba aiþeins seinaizos aftra
galeiþan jag-gabairaidau</HI>  (potestne nasci?).</P> <P COM="1052">«Annotatio.—In Luc. XIX, 8  <HI REND="ITALIC">halbata aiginis meinis
gadailjau unledaim,</HI>  adesse conjunctivum neque
ex graeco ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>divdwmi</FOREIGN> ), neque ex sensu, quem solum sententia
patitur, conjiciendum est; probabilius est
