 <HI REND="ITALIC">fraujan;</HI>  Mth. VI, 9  <HI REND="ITALIC">sva nu bidjaiþ</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>proseuvcesqe</FOREIGN> ); Joan.
XIII, 27  <HI REND="ITALIC">þatei taujis, tavei</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>poivhson</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">sprauto;</HI>  Rom.
XIII, 4  <HI REND="ITALIC">þiuþ taujais</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>poivei</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">jah habais hazein us
þamma;</HI>  Joan. VI, 10  <HI REND="ITALIC">vaurkeiþ</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>poihvsate</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">þans
