freis magt vairþan, mais brukei</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>crhðsai</FOREIGN> ); Tim. I, V,
23  <HI REND="ITALIC">ni drigkais þanamais vato</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mhú uJdropovtei</FOREIGN> ),  <HI REND="ITALIC">ak veinis
