ponitur apud Joan. X, 22 pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>taú ejgkaivnia</FOREIGN> ;  <HI REND="ITALIC">mel gabaurþais</HI> 
dies nativitatis Mc. VI, 21 pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>taú genevsia. Taú
eujwvnuma</FOREIGN>  et  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>taú taj dexiav</FOREIGN>  (omne quod a sinistris et a
