23),  <HI REND="ITALIC">himins</HI>   <CITN>(Mth. V, 16)</CITN>  et  <HI REND="ITALIC">himinos</HI>  (vs. 18, etc.). Plurima
alia vocabula in plurali frequentius ponuntur,
