20  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>perisseuvei hJ dikaiosuvnh uJmwðn pleiðon twðn grammatevwn</FOREIGN> 
per  <HI REND="ITALIC">managizo vairþiþ garaihteins ïzvaraizos þau
