IV, 16; temetipsum ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>seautoún, eJautovn</FOREIGN> ): Mth, VIII, 4
 <HI REND="ITALIC">gagg þuk silban ataugei gudjin;</HI>  Mc. I, 44; XII,
