4; VIII, 13, 53; XIV, 22; Rom. XIII, 9; Gal. V, 14;
VI, 1; Tim. I, IV, 16; II, II, 15; Philem. 19; vobismetipsis
( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eJautoiðû</FOREIGN> ): Joan. VI, 53  <HI REND="ITALIC">ni habaiþ libain ïn
ïzvis silbam;</HI>  Rom. XI, 25; XII, 16; Cor. I, V,
13; vosmetipsos ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eJautouvû</FOREIGN> ): Luc. XVI, 15  <HI REND="ITALIC">garaihtans
