ïzvara ïn ïzvis misso;</HI>  Luc. XVI, 5  <HI REND="ITALIC">athaitands ainwarjanoh</HI> 
( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eåna eåkaston</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">faihuskulane qaþ þamma frumistin;</HI> 
IV, 40  <HI REND="ITALIC">ainwarjammeh</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eJniú eJkavstwé</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">ïze handuns
