 <COL N="1132"></COL> Judaei, etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Interpr.</HI></NOTE> .</P> <P COM="1131">«Annotatio 1 <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1132" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1132"></COL> Hanc annotationem, licet ad solos Germanos
pertineat, integre vertimus, sive quia grammaticam
