(galli cantus); Cor. I, XV, 52  <HI REND="ITALIC">braw augins</HI>  germ.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Augenblick</HI>  (ictus oculi).</P> <P COM="1132">«Plurima graeca composita eo modo gothice circumscribuntur:
