corporali specie)  <HI REND="ITALIC">leikis siunai</HI>  (in corporis specie);
Tim. I, IV, 7  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>grawvdeiû muðqoi</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">usalþanaizo spilla;</HI>  Cor.
II, III, 10  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJperbavllousa dovxa</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ufarassus vulþaus,</HI>  et sic
