Col. IV, 10; Philem. 23,  <HI REND="ITALIC">miþgasinþa</HI>  Cor. II, VIII,
19 cod. A;  <HI REND="ITALIC">usstass</HI>  Cor. I, XV, 12 ( <HI REND="ITALIC">usstass dauþaim</HI> ).</P> <P COM="1146">«Annotatio.—Haec constructio, quam Gothus e
Graeco imitatus est, in priori versionis parte non
