( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>twðn pistwðn</FOREIGN> ); I, 16; Rom. XI, 12  <HI REND="ITALIC">missadeds
ïze gabei fariwau jah vanins ïze gabei þiudom</HI>  (v. 15
