exprimitur</P> <P COM="1149">1) Simpliciter per  <HI REND="ITALIC">visan:</HI>  Cor. I, X, 26,  <HI REND="ITALIC">fraujins
ïst</HI>  (pertinet)  <HI REND="ITALIC">airþa;</HI>  Luc. XX, 33  <HI REND="ITALIC">warjis þize vairþiþ</HI> 
