7; Thess. I, V, 5  <HI REND="ITALIC">ni siuþ nahts ni riqizis;</HI>  Mc. X,
14  <HI REND="ITALIC">þize ïst þiudangardi guþs;</HI>  Luc. XVIII, 16; V, 3
