II, 49; Cor. II, XI, 30  <CITN>(vid. supra § 195, IV, 3)</CITN> .</P> <P COM="1150">«Annotatio 2.—Paulo audacius Rom. XIV, 19  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>taú
thðû eijrhvnhû—taú thðû oijkodomhðû</FOREIGN>  gothice circumscribitur
