mirari; Luc. XX, 26  <HI REND="ITALIC">sildaleikjandans andavaurde
ïs gaþahaidedun;</HI>  cum  <HI REND="ITALIC">vopjan</HI>  accumbere: Luc. VII,
32  <HI REND="ITALIC">galeikai sind barnam þaim ïn garunsai sitandam
jah vopjandam sei na misso</HI> <NOTE N="*" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1154" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1154"></COL> Vid. notam ad calcem voluminis.</NOTE> . Ex causali etiam
illustratur lectio codicis B a nobis impugnata Cor.
