silban xristu ïna visan;</HI>  Cor. I, XVI, 7
 <HI REND="ITALIC">venja mik wo weilo saljan</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejlpivzw—ejpimeiðnai</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">at
ïzvis;</HI>  II, V, 11;</P> <P COM="1179">4) Post verba faciendi, operandi, parandi: Mc. I,
17  <HI REND="ITALIC">gatauja ïgqis vairþan nutans manne,</HI>  Luc. V,
