17  <HI REND="ITALIC">azetizo ïst himin jah airþa hindarleiþan
þau vitodis ainana vrit gadriusan;</HI>  Joan. XVIII,
14  <HI REND="ITALIC">batizo ïst, ainana mannan fraqistjan faur
managein;</HI>  Rom. XIII, 11  <HI REND="ITALIC">mel ïst uns us slepa urreisan.</HI></P> <P COM="1179">«Annotatio 1.—Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">varþ, aglu ïst, azetizo ïst</HI>  et
