 <COL N="1180"></COL> dauhtar ligandein</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>beblhmevnhn</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">ana ligra;</HI>  Luc.
VIII, 35. Hinc passive in nominativo Skeir. VIII, c
 <HI REND="ITALIC">liugandans bigitanda;</HI>  Phil. IV, 9. Post  <HI REND="ITALIC">viljan</HI>  ambae
constructiones reperiuntur connexae: Tim. I, II, 8, 9
 <HI REND="ITALIC">viljau vairans bidjan</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>proûeuvcesqai</FOREIGN> )— <HI REND="ITALIC">samaleiko jah
