jera fidrortaihune fravulvanana</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aJrpagevnta</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">und
þridjan himin jah vait þana svaleikana mannan þatei
fravulvans varþ</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oåti hJrpavgh</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">ïn vagg.</HI></P> <P COM="1180">«Insolens est autem haec constructio post  <HI REND="ITALIC">qiþan,</HI> 
