(gall.  <HI REND="ITALIC">aussi bien—que</HI> ), ubi ambae cogitationes
aeque procedunt;  <HI REND="ITALIC">ni þatainei—ak jah</HI>  non solum—sed
etiam, ubi alterutra in lucem proferenda est:
Joan. III, 23  <HI REND="ITALIC">þaruh qemun jah daupidai vesun;</HI> 
