negatione, tantummodo, sed significat.»</P></DIV4> <DIV4 SECOND=YES COM="1194"><HEAD COM="1194">3. SENTENTIA DISJUNCTIVA.</HEAD> <P COM="1194">§ 261. 1) Membra sententiae disjuncta indicantur per
simplex  <HI REND="ITALIC">aiþþau</HI>  vel, vel per  <HI REND="ITALIC">jabai—aiþþau, andizuh—aiþþau</HI> 
vel—vel: Mth. V, 17  <HI REND="ITALIC">ni qam gatairan
