meljam ïzvis alja þoei</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hÞ aå</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">anakunnaiþ, aiþþau jah
ufkunnaiþ.</HI>  Alia exempla pro simplici  <HI REND="ITALIC">aiþþau</HI>  vid.
gloss. h. v.</P> <P COM="1194">2) In disjunctivis interrogationibus priori membro
