 <HI REND="ITALIC">þau</HI>  3).</P></DIV4> <DIV4 SECOND=YES COM="1195"><HEAD COM="1195">4. SENTENTIA CAUSALIS ET CONSECUTIVA.</HEAD> <P COM="1195">§ 262. 1) Sententia causalis vel propositionem praecedentem
