§ 182, I. In circumscriptione Col. II, 22  <HI REND="ITALIC">þairh
þatei ïs brukjaidau</HI>  (quo id adhibeatur) pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>thð ajpocrhvsei,</FOREIGN> 
