ïesus</HI></P> <P COM="1200"><HI REND="ITALIC">f</HI> ) Huc adducenda sunt etiam correlativa:  <HI REND="ITALIC">wileiks—svaleiks</HI> 
qualis—talis et ordinario absolute occurrens
