ut Col. I, 10,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>paðsa ajrevskeia</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">all þatei galeikai.</HI> 
Hic etiam interrogativum loco relativi ponitur:
Col. IV, 8  <HI REND="ITALIC">ïnsandida ïna du ïzvis ei kannjai wa
