( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eij ejkbavlleiû</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">uns, uslaubei uns galeiþan ïn
þo hairda;</HI>  Col. III, 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">jabai miþurrisuþ</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eij sunhgevrqhte</FOREIGN> )
 <HI REND="ITALIC">xristau, þoei ïupa sind sokeiþ;</HI>  Gal. II, 14  <HI REND="ITALIC">jabai
þu ïudaius visands þiudisko libais</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eij zhðéû</FOREIGN> ),  <HI REND="ITALIC">waiva
