 <HI REND="ITALIC">aber sagen wir</HI> ), pro si diximus ([ <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejaún] eiæpwmen</FOREIGN> ).»</P> <P COM="1219">« <HI REND="ITALIC">c</HI> ) Ubi sententia ut antecedenti opposita exhibetur,
