aþþan</HI> <NOTE N="1" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1219" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1219"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Aþþan</HI>  enim pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">aiþþau</HI>  legendum est, vid.
