II, 1) et  <HI REND="ITALIC">þe 2) a</HI> )  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>b</FOREIGN> ).</P> <P COM="1221">Mth. VI, 2  <HI REND="ITALIC">þan taujais armaion, ni haurnjais
faura þus; </HI> 5 <HI REND="ITALIC"> þan bidjaiþ, ni sijaiþ svasve þai liutans.
