19; XIV, 29; XVI, 4; Cor. I, XVI, 2.</P> <P COM="1221">2) Cum ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oåte, ejpeiv, wJû</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">þan, biþe</HI>  (quamvis haec
