ouß, mevcriû ouß</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">unte</HI>  construitur.</P> <P COM="1223"><HI REND="ITALIC">a</HI> ) Cum indicativo</P> <P COM="1223"><HI REND="ITALIC">aa</HI> ) Praesentis: Mth. V, 26  <HI REND="ITALIC">ni usgaggis jainþro,
unte usgibis þana minnistan kintu;</HI>  Mc. XII, 36
