X, 24 et annot. 6.»</P> <CAPTION COM="1224">ELLIPSES IN COMPOSITA SENTENTIA.</CAPTION> <P COM="1224">§ 283. De ellipsibus in composita sententia occurrentibus
jam obiter quaestio fuit, ubi nonnullas particulas,
quandoque deficientes, passim tractavimus,
coll. §§ 258, annot. 6 et 12, 270 1); 280, annot. 3.
Adde, quod integra per sententia particulam, ex. gr.
per  <HI REND="ITALIC">aiþþau,</HI>  vid. § 280, annot. 3  <HI REND="ITALIC">c</HI> ) suppleri possit;
necnon et particula ipsa supplemento sententiae
quandoque indigeat, ut illustretur, ex gr.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ïbai</HI>  ne,
proprie (timendum est) ne, vid. § 273, 2.</P></DIV4></DIV3></DIV2> <DIV2 SECOND=YES COM="1224"><HEAD COM="1224">D. APPENDIX.</HEAD> <COL N="1223"></COL> <DIV3 SECOND=YES COM="1223"><HEAD COM="1223">PLEONASMUS.</HEAD> <P COM="1223">284, 1) Pleonasmus in eo consistit, quod attributum
vel objectum expresse adjiciatur, cujus idea jam
in verbo vel nomine jacet: Mth. IX, 23  <HI REND="ITALIC">haurnjans
