obstupentes ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eJfobhvqhsan</FOREIGN> ); Mc. I, 27  <HI REND="ITALIC">afslauþ nodedun
allai sildaleikjandans</HI>  mirabantur stupescentes
( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejqambhvqhsan</FOREIGN> ); II, 12  <HI REND="ITALIC">usgeisnodedun allai
jah hauhidedun mikiljandans guþ</HI>  exaltabant
