 <HI REND="ITALIC">wazuh saei haifstjan sniviþ, allis sik gaþarbiþ</HI> 
qui it pugnaturus ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oJ ajgwnizovmenoû,</FOREIGN>  ubi Gothus ad
