( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>fobeiðaqai fovbon</FOREIGN> ); Mc. VII, 7  <HI REND="ITALIC">svare mik blotand laisjandans
laiseinins</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>didavskonteû didaskalivaû</FOREIGN> ); XIV,
