ïn allaim du ïsvis;</HI>  e) in respectu ad, comparative
ad, prae,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>provû</FOREIGN>  c. accus., in locutionibus  <HI REND="ITALIC">gaggan
gafehaba du þaim þaiei uta sind</HI>  Thess. I, IV, 12,  <HI REND="ITALIC">gaggan
ïn handugein du þaim uta</HI>  Col. IV, 5,  <HI REND="ITALIC">raihtaba
gaggan du sunjai</HI>  Gal. II, 14; f) in,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijû,</FOREIGN>  in quantum
