est autem Mth. XXVII, 7  <HI REND="ITALIC">du usfilhan</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijû tafhvn</FOREIGN> ), quod  <HI REND="ITALIC">du
usfilham</HI>  legendum esset, vid. ad h. l.—d) Pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>proúû
tov</FOREIGN>  c infinitivo: Mth. V, 28  <HI REND="ITALIC">saiwan qinon du luston
ïzos;</HI>  VI, 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">armaion taujan ïn andvairþja manne du
saiwan ïm;</HI>  Mc. XIII, 22  <HI REND="ITALIC">giband taiknins du afairzjan.</HI> —e)
Pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpiv twðé</FOREIGN>  c. infin.: Cor. I, XI, 21  <HI REND="ITALIC">faursnivan
du matjan.</HI> —f) Pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eiåneken</FOREIGN>  c. infin.: Cor. II, VII,
12  <HI REND="ITALIC">melida du gabairhtjan usdaudein.</HI> —g) Pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>iåna</FOREIGN> :
Mc. III, 14  <HI REND="ITALIC">gavaurhta tvalif du visan</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>iåna wøsi</FOREIGN> )  <HI REND="ITALIC">miþ
