 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>keklhmevnoû</FOREIGN> : Luc. XIV, 24, etiam redundanter,
ut Tim. I, I, 18  <HI REND="ITALIC">faura faursnivan.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>C. In compositione: a) cum verbis:  <HI REND="ITALIC">fauragaggan,
